WEBVTT

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:09.250
Go to the sign in page, "/admin/login".

00:00:12.877 --> 00:00:18.877
Type your email in the Email box.

00:00:22.235 --> 00:00:28.235
Type "wrongpassword"
in the Password box.

00:00:33.068 --> 00:00:39.068
Click Sign in.

00:00:40.668 --> 00:00:46.668
Check the Sign in heading and
the message above the boxes.

00:00:53.377 --> 00:00:59.377
Type your password in the Password box.

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:09.540
Click Sign in again.

00:01:11.156 --> 00:01:17.156
Check the Enter your code page.
